WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.140
...crazy about you!

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.490
"'Student Identification No. 333c"'

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:53.330
"'Imaginary Love Affair"'

00:01:53.330 --> 00:02:01.300
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.000
Adachi?

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.340
Did you find that paper?

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:05.670
Hmm? Something wrong?

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.830
Unh-unh... Come on, let's go.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:24.080
Why did Okayasu have my picture?

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.550
Why?

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:29.220
Huh?

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:34.260
l thought that seat was
reserved for Misao-chan.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.000
Adachi!

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:44.710
What do you wanna do? Shall we
go to the movies for a change?

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.710
No place with lots of people...

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.880
Then how about my place?
I have lots of movies on DVDs.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:57.720
Oh, my God! How did l suddenly...

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.950
...end up here?!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:01.890
Come on in.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.330
What's wrong?

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:10.100
I just had a little flashback...

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.060
After all, last time I was here,
you turned me away.

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.580
Silly girl! That's all past.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:43.700
l haven't been in Toji's room in ages.
lt hasn't changed a bit...

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:48.710
But ''ages!'' lt hasn't
even been a year yet.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:53.050
So much has happened in
that time. Okayasu and all...

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:57.720
l ended up never returning that...

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.810
l wonder if Okayasu is
looking for his lD book...

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.420
And the photo...

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.000
Are you bored?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.330
Huh? Why would I be?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:17.670
Somehow... you look like
your mind is somewhere else.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:21.340
That's not true! I'm watching!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.340
Okay...

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:26.010
l'm so dumb! How long am l gonna
keep thinking about Okayasu?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:31.570
Who cares about that now? l'm here,
with Toji, and l'm completely happy!

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.070
D- don't!

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.570
I'm sorry.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:06.980
Don't say that.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.320
I'm sorry, too.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:15.990
When I see you looking pre-occupied,
Adachi, I get anxious.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:19.670
I think you're thinking about Okayasu.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.330
With the way you two ended things,

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:24.000
it's natural that it'll take some time
to get your feelings straightened out,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:29.010
but I want to get back to the way
we were as soon as possible.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.680
I'm sorry, I...

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:35.350
No, it would be unreasonable for you not
to be thinking of him. You can mull it over.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.020
After all, Okayasu did happen.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.080
I accept all of that.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:47.030
Adachi, until your heart turns 100%
in my direction, I'll wait patiently.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.050
Toji...

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:52.700
Thank you!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.030
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.370
No, I'll walk you home.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.370
l can't believe how suddenly relaxed l feel.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.310
But at the same time...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.980
l feel guilty...

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:07.410
The truth is, l was really
happy about that photograph.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:10.870
Really happy...

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:20.330
Waiting long?

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:24.330
Mm-mm... I'm sorry to call you out
to see me. What about your work?

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:29.170
I'm all done. Aki, I was
thrilled that you called me.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.670
Why don't we make this into a date?

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:33.970
Listen, Ryo-kun...

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:41.350
--Yes?
--You're late, you stupid jerk!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.680
I told you 6:00 at the plaza in front
of the station! Where are you?!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:47.350
Uh-oh, I forgot.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:49.820
I'll be right there.
Just wait a few minutes.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.690
You were supposed to meet Kairi?

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:56.890
Yeah. Aki, come with me!
I want to show you off!

00:06:58.360 --> 00:06:59.700
Aki?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.630
What's wrong, Aki?

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.900
That confession of love
I made to you the other day?

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.540
I want you to forget I ever said it.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.980
Huh? But why?

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:16.310
All I was doing was thinking of myself.
I was consumed with the need to tell you,

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:19.990
but Ryo-kun, I never intended to break up
your relationship with Kashiwagi-san.

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:23.990
Oh! Is that it? Then you
don't have to worry.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:27.660
Aki, even if you weren't in the picture,
Sae-chan and I are through.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.990
Why?!

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:33.330
The truth is, she's been
following me around, and I don't like it.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:37.670
Somehow, Sae-chan has made me
into her imaginary boyfriend.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.730
What? Imaginary... boyfriend?

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:46.440
I'll deal with her, so you
don't have to worry.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.350
Why are you with that woman?!

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.350
You tricked me, huh?

00:07:56.350 --> 00:08:01.630
You bastard! You won't answer my
phone calls, but you're seeing her?! Why?

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:05.300
Why? Because being with Aki heals me.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.300
So being with me doesn't?!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:12.640
Sae-chan, you're intoxicated
with the idea of yourself loving me.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.970
You're in love with the idea of love.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:19.910
T- that's not true! I love you, Ryo-sama!

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:23.980
You're the only one I want!
What do you see in her?!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.650
What is it she'll do for you, Ryo-sama?!

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:35.330
Nothing. But when she's
by my side, I feel at ease.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.660
She doesn't have to do anything
for me. Just be with me...

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.330
Why?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:44.000
This is your fault!
Give me back my Ryo-sama!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.340
Sae-chan...

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:50.140
You're mistaken. You and I have
never had a relationship, have we?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.010
Thank you. I'm fine from here.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.680
I still...

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.620
I want to be with you a little longer...

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.620
Okay. A little longer.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:06.060
What's that? Has something
happened over there?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:11.630
Then why did you sleep with me?!

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.630
You said I was lovely!

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.970
--Must be a fight or something. Let's go.
--You said you'd make me happy!

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.870
--Hm? That voice...
--You said you'd make me happy!

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.640
Sae!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:23.310
You said those things, right, Ryo-sama?!

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:27.980
Let's stop this. You shouldn't embarrass
yourself any more than you have.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:30.650
Nothing you can say will change things.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.650
Let's go, Aki.

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:32.840
But...

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.660
Wait, Ryo!

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:45.720
I'm pregnant!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.330
P- pregnant?!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.670
It's your responsibility.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.340
She's pregnant?

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.010
Wow, for real?

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.670
What did you say?

00:09:55.670 --> 00:10:00.010
Didn't you hear me? I said I'm pregnant,
so take the responsibility!

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:04.910
Lying won't get you anywhere, Sae-chan.
You're really good at lying.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:10.020
It's not a lie! It's the truth! It's true!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.690
She was always doing this,

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.690
calling me up with some lie
so I'd go meet her. And now this!

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:15.680
Come on, let's go.

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.030
A young girl has accused you
of something serious!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:23.370
You have to listen to what she has to say!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:28.370
As an adult, you have to at least
hear her out! Right, Ryo-kun?!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.380
Okay...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:34.180
This is no place for a
discussion like this. Let's go!

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.720
Geez, is that it?

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.850
Man! I wanted to see more of that!

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:50.030
My, my! What a coincidence!
Did you see what just happened?

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:51.730
Did the two of you see that?!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:57.070
Um... We came in the middle of it.
Why is your brother with Misao-sensei?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:11:00.670
Huh?! Oh, Toji, you haven't heard!

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.340
Misao-chan confessed her love to Ryo
and it looks like they're hitting it off!

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:06.340
For all the details, ask Momo-chan.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:09.350
Me? I don't know anything!
This is the first I've heard of it!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:13.350
Oh yeah? Oh, gee! Sorry about that!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:17.360
But, boy, what a shocker!
Sae-chan declaring she's pregnant!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.360
Is it true? Your jerk of
a brother acts like it's not.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:25.600
Who knows? I'm just hearing it myself.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:28.370
But that was no way for
my jerk of a brother to act.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.700
Look at him! Talking like
everything's normal!

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.710
So, Sae's pregnancy is a lie?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:37.840
Could be! It may be,
but I'm going to go ask again.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.900
I'm going to follow those three! See you!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.710
Shall we go, too?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.050
Yeah...

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:51.390
Maybe that photo didn't
mean anything at all...

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:56.530
l wonder if Okayasu still cares for me...
l'm way overdoing this!

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.500
l'm too self-conscious, l guess.

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:12.370
Ah, sheesh... Momo-chan...

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:19.020
Hm? My ID book is gone. I put it in here!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.420
Huh?! Did I drop it?!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:25.690
If anyone sees that, I'm in trouble!

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:29.990
No, wait. We were going together,
so having a photo is normal.

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:31.460
It's okay, it's okay.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.380
Momo-chan...

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.110
You're so pretty...

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:54.720
Okayasu, just being
with you makes me happy...

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:57.390
Momo-chan...

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.120
I love you, Momo-chan!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.370
No, I can't do this!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.700
I have to have Momo-chan!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:32.360
She's not home...

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.420
Right, she's with Toji...

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.370
That dog is really barking tonight.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:49.040
Stupid dog.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.710
Huh? It stopped.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.840
Maybe they put it in the house.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:59.380
Thank you. You ended up
walking me all the way home!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.650
That's okay. I wanted to.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.320
Well, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.310
Mm-hmm.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.660
Good night.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:36.510
There's that stupid dog again.
I wonder if someone is out there. Toji?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.860
W- what are you doing here?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.700
It looks like I'm a little lost...

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.710
But I know where I am now, so... bye!

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:55.710
Okayasu!

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:59.800
Okayasu! Wait!
You came here for a reason!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.990
I'm sorry.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:08.990
Okayasu...

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:11.350
I'm all emotional... I'm sorry!

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:18.190
What was Okayasu crying for?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:25.060
What on earth am I doing?

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.240
Oh, look! It's the ocean! The ocean!

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.310
Wowee! That feels so wonderful!

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:41.020
Aren't you tired, Sae-chan?

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:46.690
No, I'm fine! I can't tell you how long
it's been since I've felt so refreshed!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:47.780
Good.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:53.860
I'm so glad! Yesterday,
I thought you hated me.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:57.360
Now, the two of you talk this
over carefully, all right?

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:07.310
Why? I promised I'd take
you on a drive, and I have.

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:12.650
Yeah! Okay, okay!
Where shall we go next? I'd like...

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:15.990
We have to talk, Sae-chan.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.320
Here. I'd like you to take this.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:21.330
Eh? What's this?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.990
This is...

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:27.330
Sae-chan, I can't be your lover.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:32.000
Right now, the only one I can think
of is Aki. I need to be good to her.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:36.670
What do you mean?! What about me?!
What about the baby I'm carrying?!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:39.680
It's not a lie! It's not!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:40.680
This is for...

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:44.120
I have no intention of being a father.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:47.350
Sae-chan, you can use the money
however you see fit.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.380
You're such a bastard!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.890
Anyway, I want this to be the end of it.

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.360
I'll drive you back...

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.970
Do as you please. The station is that way.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:08.310
W- wait, Ryo! No! I need you, Ryo!
Don't leave me alone!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:11.980
Please! I'll do anything you ask!

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:16.980
Anything? In that case,
I have just one favor to ask.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:19.650
What?! Ask me anything! I'll do anything!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.880
Then, stop seeing me.

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.990
Ryo...

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.260
Ryo!!

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:31.090
"'Girls' Bathroom"'

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:35.360
l wonder how long he was out there...

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.300
He probably saw the kiss
between Toji and me...

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.940
What was he feeling emotional about?

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:53.350
It's that woman's fault...
It's her fault...

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.410
Sae...

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:59.590
Are you feeling all right?
You're awfully pale.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:07.300
Sae, um... on Friday, Toji and I went
to the plaza in front of the station,

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:09.730
and by coincidence, we saw you.

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:15.330
And... um... Is it true you're pregnant?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:22.150
So, it is...

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:25.650
Then, what are you going to do?
What about Kairi's jerk of a big brother?

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:29.350
Oh, don't worry! We've talked
it all over! Everything's fine!

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.000
Sensei! Are you okay?!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.300
That was close! One more step,
and it woulda hit you right on the head!

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:59.680
This is probably Sae-chan's work.
She was acting very strangely.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:05.620
But don't jump to any conclusions.
I didn't see who it was at all.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.620
But still...

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:10.960
To be sure,
Kashiwagi-san probably hates my guts.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.970
Don't you think it's a
warning to stay away from Ryo?

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:18.300
I'm thinking that maybe I shouldn't
see Ryo-kun anymore, either.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:19.800
Are you serious?!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:23.640
If that's what you think, Misao-chan,
then you better cut it off quick!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.080
The way he acted last night
was Ryo's real nature!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.150
What have I been doing?

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.920
All this time I was so busy
trying to look good to Ryo-kun

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:39.320
that I never looked at the real him.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:44.000
I know that I ought to give up on him,
but my feelings won't obey me...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.000
Misao-chan...

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.030
I know what you mean! I know!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:51.670
Your heart's all screwed up,
and you don't know what you oughta do!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.640
Kairi...

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.370
W- whoa! Look at that!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:02.010
Oh, please! Think where you are!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.450
Let's get outta here.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:09.350
Momo-chan! J- just a minute!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.690
Momo-chan!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:11.690
What?!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.020
Ah! Um...

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.360
Never mind.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.350
Sorry. You guys go on...

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:20.930
Okayasu...

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.040
What is it?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:27.040
About last night... I'm sorry.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.470
I was in shock about
Misao-chan and I somehow

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:32.040
ended up at your house, Momo-chan.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:36.050
Momo-chan, you're the only person
who knows about Misao-chan,

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:38.720
and I had no one else to talk to...

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.720
l'm all emotional... l'm sorry!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.390
So, that's what he was emotional about...

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:47.390
I'm sorry you had to see me
looking so unmanly! See ya...

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:50.060
lt was Misao-chan
he was emotional about...

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:52.360
How could l make such a mistake?

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:58.740
It's red, Adachi!

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:02.340
What's wrong with you? You're in
a daze. Has something happened?

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:04.680
No, nothing!

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:08.610
l'm sick of all this! l'm being dragged
all over the place by Okayasu!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:12.510
"'Toyama Family Land"'

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.020
You know, I...

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:23.690
I really wanted to come here
with you again, Adachi.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:28.930
This is where we broke up. I didn't
want that to be our last memory here.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:36.710
But we had a really good time here today,
so when you think of this place,

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:37.940
it won't make you sad.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:44.720
From now on, let's make lots
and lots of happy memories...

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:45.700
Okay?

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:42.810
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:52.480
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:55.480
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.480 --> 00:23:02.090
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:08.430
Where can we go

00:23:08.430 --> 00:23:18.110
where we can all be

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:20.780
under the same sky?

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:29.120
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.120 --> 00:23:35.790
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:42.130
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:49.470
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:57.470
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:04.420
Choose? Right here? Between these two?

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:10.760
Why? Why am l hesitating? l don't know!
l don't know how l feel!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:14.560
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'Forced to Choose"'
